# Commit messages

All commit messages — from humans, the Cursor commit UI, or any agent —
follow **[docs/commit-style.md](../../docs/commit-style.md)**:

`type: imperative short description` on one line, ≤ ~72 chars, optional
body after a blank line.

**One-line hint when generating:** `conventional commit, <72 chars, feat/refactor/fix`
